Rill is the default TaijiOS desktop in this tree.

Use the desktop menu or the Run command to open bundled programs.
ktrem opens the terminal, and startwm starts the unified Rill desktop.
The taskbar switches between native and supported Debian applications.
Terminal, Files, and Settings open in their own native windows.

Native and supported Debian X11 applications share the desktop. From a text
prompt, run startwm to enter it; individual programs such as acme can still
be launched directly. See /doc/unified-desktop.md for the Linux app setup.
